  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2042809626776305752
      type: {class: ConditionalNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 0
        text: Let me see if you are ready.
        conditions:
        - conditionType: 0
          questID: 0637777c-5273-4b34-aaaf-383c110b49a6
          itemID: 
          dialogue: {fileID: 0}
        trueNodeID: 2
        falseNodeID: 1
    - rid: 2042809626776305756
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 1
        text: No you are not, seek out Anger, Bargaining and Depression.
        nextNodeID: 
    - rid: 2042809626776305757
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 2
        text: Have you finally figured it out?
        nextNodeID: 3
    - rid: 2042809626776305758
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 3
        text: Have you accepted the truth?
        nextNodeID: 4
    - rid: 2042809626776305759
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 4
        text: Are you ready to move on from this plane and move forwards in your
          journey?
        nextNodeID: 5
    - rid: 2042809626776305760
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 5
        text: Or will you be forsaken and doomed to become a wallflower of this realm?
        choices:
        - choiceText: Who are you? What happened to the little kid?
          nextNodeID: 6
        - choiceText: Whats going on? Who are you?
          nextNodeID: 6
    - rid: 2042809626776305761
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 6
        text: Who i am is not important, the child you saw before you, was just one
          of my many forms. Necessary for your journey forwards
        choices:
        - choiceText: Journey forwards? I don't understand what are you talking about?
          nextNodeID: 7
    - rid: 2042809626776305762
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 7
        text: 'I have been watching you, guiding you, from the moment you first arrived
          here. '
        nextNodeID: 8
    - rid: 2042809626776305763
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 8
        text: So you may move on peacefully to the afterlife. As to accept which
          is true, is to move on.
        choices:
        - choiceText: You have been guiding me? What even is this place?
          nextNodeID: 9
    - rid: 2042809626776305764
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 9
        text: This place, is a plane between life and death.
        nextNodeID: 10
    - rid: 2042809626776305765
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 10
        text: A bridge standing between those who are troubled and the afterlife.
        nextNodeID: 11
    - rid: 2042809626776305766
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 11
        text: That will determine if you are worthy and ready to move on.
        choices:
        - choiceText: Bridge? What do you mean?
          nextNodeID: 12
    - rid: 2042809626776305767
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 12
        text: When you first came here, you were still troubled, obsessed even.
        nextNodeID: 13
    - rid: 2042809626776305768
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 13
        text: But by walking this bridge you have learned to accept and change your
          way of thinking.
        nextNodeID: 14
    - rid: 2042809626776305769
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 14
        text: Have you not?
        nextNodeID: 15
    - rid: 2042809626776305770
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 15
        text: 'By taking this journey and overcoming its many challenges. '
        nextNodeID: 16
    - rid: 2042809626776305771
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 16
        text: You have moved on and became ready to enter the afterlife.
        choices:
        - choiceText: What would have happened if I couldn't move on? If I did not
            overcome the challenges?
          nextNodeID: 17
    - rid: 2042809626776305772
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 17
        text: Dwelling on what could or couldn't have been is a fools way of thinking.
        nextNodeID: 18
    - rid: 2042809626776305773
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 18
        text: All that matters is that you DID overcome the challenges and that you
          accepted your fate.
        nextNodeID: 19
    - rid: 2042809626776305774
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 19
        text: Fretting over what could have been is pointless...
        choices:
        - choiceText: So what awaits me in the afterlife?
          nextNodeID: 20
    - rid: 2042809626776305775
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 20
        text: Even I do not know what awaits you in the afterlife.
        nextNodeID: 21
    - rid: 2042809626776305776
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 21
        text: That will be for you and only you to figure out.
        nextNodeID: 22
    - rid: 2042809626776305777
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 22
        text: So i once again ask you, Are you ready?
        nextNodeID: 23
    - rid: 2042809626776305778
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 23
        text: Ready to take the next step in your journey and move on to the after
          life?
        choices:
        - choiceText: Yes, I am ready to move on.
          nextNodeID: 24
    - rid: 2042809626776305779
      type: {class: StartQuestNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: 24
        text: Then place your hand on the pedestal next to me.
        questToStart: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8cdbfff822a78f84f9dce3087ca98e9d, type: 2}
        nextNodeID: 
